SUMMARY:1\, 2\, 3\, A Little Space for Me
DESCRIPTION:Small spaces can hold big discoveries. Designed for children under three with their parents\, this environment is divided into three distinct zones: movement\, hands-on exploration\, and quiet play. Each area offers a different way to engage\, from active motion to focused interaction and calm building. The experience supports early development through movement\, touch\, and shared exploration.
